      "reason": "The accepted 21.01 importer overcaptured the source-owned 21.02 surge diagram/SEE ALSO and 21.03 flying diagram. Their source words are unchanged; the move restores their numbered owners rather than deleting text.",
      "removedSentences": [
        {
          "text": "SEE ALSO",
