          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-02-surge-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-02",
          "destinationAnchor": "SURGE-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Rules Sequencing 01.03.02",
          "normalizedSHA256": "3c5fe378ffe8100fb04c63760baa4a377bf8175d3a85f2fa288577e7345a0f7c",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "3c5fe378ffe8100fb04c63760baa4a377bf8175d3a85f2fa288577e7345a0f7c",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-02-surge-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-02",
          "destinationAnchor": "SURGE-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "MAKING A SURGE MOVE",
          "normalizedSHA256": "3a149c717eb6846d4b9311c9d4ac846a13d9da6b45334d0c21c6b22cf11094de",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "3a149c717eb6846d4b9311c9d4ac846a13d9da6b45334d0c21c6b22cf11094de",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-02-surge-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-02",
          "destinationAnchor": "SURGE-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Unit A shoots, and destroys two models from unit B.",
          "normalizedSHA256": "e43c866c94d915982ebabcfd5f6c81da490aa1ab8d12f6f6235201559cac71c6",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "e43c866c94d915982ebabcfd5f6c81da490aa1ab8d12f6f6235201559cac71c6",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-02-surge-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-02",
          "destinationAnchor": "SURGE-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Unit B has an ability that allows it to make a surge move of D6\" after an enemy unit has shot, if one or more of its models were destroyed by those attacks.",
          "normalizedSHA256": "b104e62e8a759d7af6080b97be006a93720d096798c10e924e89b2619dc6f343",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "b104e62e8a759d7af6080b97be006a93720d096798c10e924e89b2619dc6f343",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-02-surge-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-02",
          "destinationAnchor": "SURGE-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "The active player rolls one D6, resulting in a 4.",
          "normalizedSHA256": "a8f8a58635534cd2089324a3f2ca7e835743bb7d6958650d618f9c2c9e403a12",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "a8f8a58635534cd2089324a3f2ca7e835743bb7d6958650d618f9c2c9e403a12",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-02-surge-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-02",
          "destinationAnchor": "SURGE-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Unit B makes a surge move, each of its surviving models moving up to 4\" towards the closest enemy unit (unit C).",
          "normalizedSHA256": "322af1b33e081945f21755719a494de8093eee3df45304ee0fd7e864ebab625e",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "322af1b33e081945f21755719a494de8093eee3df45304ee0fd7e864ebab625e",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-02-surge-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-02",
          "destinationAnchor": "SURGE-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "It ends this move engaged with that unit.",
          "normalizedSHA256": "f77b21b2241cd225191a1a7087694c498a3d85a3bd3f257d6a2b6e31c776eb8e",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "f77b21b2241cd225191a1a7087694c498a3d85a3bd3f257d6a2b6e31c776eb8e",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-02-surge-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-02",
          "destinationAnchor": "SURGE-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "TAKING TO THE SKIES",
          "normalizedSHA256": "42ed1ff8f4fe77ecf578ba7022fb19d4a9df7ed93f3f284412b4582af7729933",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "42ed1ff8f4fe77ecf578ba7022fb19d4a9df7ed93f3f284412b4582af7729933",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-03-flying-models",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-03",
          "destinationAnchor": "Flying-Models"
        },
        {
          "text": "• This Riptide Battlesuit can FLY.",
          "normalizedSHA256": "067ea6dcdbe6604d680e49d39219ee1bad33b06d985e1eb68d972697e42627e0",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "067ea6dcdbe6604d680e49d39219ee1bad33b06d985e1eb68d972697e42627e0",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-03-flying-models",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-03",
          "destinationAnchor": "Flying-Models"
        },
        {
          "text": "It makes an advance move with a maximum distance of 16\".",
          "normalizedSHA256": "56057c441e44b2e2380d350ee07b9101d20ab1b9032574b413d704e64e966073",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "56057c441e44b2e2380d350ee07b9101d20ab1b9032574b413d704e64e966073",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-03-flying-models",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-03",
          "destinationAnchor": "Flying-Models"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Before moving the unit, the active player declares that it will take to the skies.",
          "normalizedSHA256": "b8c90cdca0fb4c5469a664f37006b907286d1b4ac8859a9ba6e3004ce6d8ed2c",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "b8c90cdca0fb4c5469a664f37006b907286d1b4ac8859a9ba6e3004ce6d8ed2c",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-03-flying-models",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-03",
          "destinationAnchor": "Flying-Models"
        },
        {
          "text": "That move’s maximum distance is reduced to 14\", but while making that move, the Riptide Battlesuit can move through all enemy units (including VEHICLES) and all terrain features, ignoring any vertical distance that would normally be counted to ascend and descend terrain features.",
          "normalizedSHA256": "225885d3250423b33e3c88e106f6fb43291a0a142c42cdeda543237342444a91",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "225885d3250423b33e3c88e106f6fb43291a0a142c42cdeda543237342444a91",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-21-03-flying-models",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-21-03",
          "destinationAnchor": "Flying-Models"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
