      "reason": "Explicit owner-authorized redistribution: these exact baseline sentences are retained by the adjacent numbered owner in the same source section; no global or cross-section search is permitted.",
      "removedSentences": [
        {
          "text": "At the end of the third battle round, unless otherwise stated, all strategic reserves units that have not made one or more ingress moves are destroyed, with the following exceptions:",
