          "destinationAnchor": "INGRESS-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Units embarked within TRANSPORTS that have made an ingress move during the battle.",
          "normalizedSentenceSHA256": "89b62b083067cd4a4a3918f6f0bea5aa6484089a30a51d414dd136ee635c8acd",
          "destinationId": "core-rule-20-04-ingress-move",
          "destinationSourceUnitId": "waha-core-rule-20-04",
          "destinationAnchor": "INGRESS-MOVE"
        },
        {
          "text": "• Repositioned units (see above).",
